  "prefLabel": "Mil 202.06 Record of the Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 202.06 Record of the Hearing. Verbatim records shall be kept of all hearings by the department, copies of which shall be available upon written request to the board.\n\nSource. #7529, eff 7-12-01; ss by #12862-A, eff 8-29-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mil100-300.html"
